The three of us sit around the table.
I serve everyone the poha.
The steaming poha looks lovely in the plates.
The smell of the hot pohe is very nice.
Amit looks at his plate and smiles.
He says, "The smell is just great!"
Neha quickly eats a spoonful of pohe.
She says happily, "Maya, these pohe are very tasty!"
"The salt and lemon are exactly right."
Amit also tastes the pohe.
He says, "Yes, these are absolutely authentic Maharashtrian pohe."
"The peanuts are also roasted very nicely."
He adds, "After that, we just want a nice tea."
I laugh and say, "Yes, I will definitely make three cups of tea."
I also take my plate and sit at the table.
We three enjoy the meal together.
We chat about our badminton games.
I am very happy today.
My friends like my Maharashtrian food a lot.
